OL,3,GNEWSASecretary of State instructs
OL,4,Aofficials to consider 'contingency
OL,5,Aplans' around budget
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe secretary of state has said he has
OL,8,Finstructed officials to consider
OL,9,F"contingency plans" around a budget for
OL,10,FNorthern Ireland, in the ongoing
OL,11,Fabsence of agreement from the executive
OL,12,Fon a funding offer.
OL,14,FLast week, Sir Chris Bryant said the
OL,15,Fdeal of #1.5bn over three years was the
OL,16,F"final offer" and had given parties a
OL,17,Fdeadline of Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
PN,41202
