OL,1,W5j 5Q7k jjs%wsj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSASecretary of State instructs
OL,4,Aofficials to consider 'contingency
OL,5,Aplans' around budget
OL,6,
OL,7,FStormont Finance Minister John O'Dowd
OL,8,Fand Ulster Unionist Party (UUP) leader
OL,9,FJon Burrows had asked the government to
OL,10,Fpush back the deadline, in light of
OL,11,Fpolitical uncertainty over the Drumcree
OL,12,Fdispute.
OL,14,FIn a letter seen by BBC News NI, Sir
OL,15,FChris said he appreciated the effect
OL,16,Frecent events have had on executive
OL,17,Fparties.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
